<!-- =========================== INTEGRATIONS =========================== -->
<section id="integrations" class="section-pad">
  <div class="max-w-shell mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="text-center reveal">
      <span class="pill" data-i18n="int.eyebrow">Integrations</span>
      <h2 class="h2 mt-6 mx-auto max-w-3xl" data-i18n="int.h2">Anything that speaks MCP already works.</h2>
      <p class="sub mt-5 mx-auto max-w-2xl" data-i18n="int.sub">Mnemosyne OS exposes its 20 tools over the standard Model Context Protocol, so it mounts without a bespoke adapter. Every transport below has a runnable or a config in the repository.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4" id="int-grid"></div>
    <p class="mt-6 text-[12px] leading-[1.7] text-fg3" data-i18n="int.note">Every entry above rides the public MCP surface — stdio or Streamable HTTP. No forked client, no vendor plugin, no private SDK.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="max-w-shell mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="hairline"></div></div>

<!-- =========================== BENCHMARKS =========================== -->
<section id="benchmarks" class="section-pad">
  <div class="max-w-shell mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">

