    <div class="text-center reveal">
      <span class="pill" data-i18n="bench.tag">New algorithm</span>
      <h2 class="h2 mt-6" data-i18n="bench.h2">Benchmarking Mnemosyne OS</h2>
      <p class="sub mt-5 mx-auto max-w-3xl" data-i18n="bench.sub">Single-pass hierarchical distillation. Multi-signal retrieval. Benchmarked across LoCoMo, LongMemEval and BEAM — the three benchmarks the memory field is actually judged on.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center">
        <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#/research" data-i18n="bench.cta">View Research<span class="btn-ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7"/><path d="M8 7h9v9"/></svg></span></a>
