        <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-fg2">
          <i class="legend-dot" style="background:#9B8DFF"></i><span data-i18n="bench.ours">Mnemosyne OS 7.0.2</span>
        </span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-fg3">
          <i class="legend-dot" style="background:#D4D4D8"></i><span data-i18n="bench.theirs">Mem0</span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div id="bench-rows"></div>
      <p class="mt-5 text-center mono text-[11px] text-fg3" id="metric-note"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 card overflow-hidden reveal">
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="spec min-w-[780px]"><thead id="spec-head"></thead><tbody id="spec-body"></tbody></table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 text-[12px] leading-[1.75] text-fg3 max-w-4xl" data-i18n="bench.note">Source note — Mnemosyne OS figures come from this project's 7.0.2 benchmark and retrieval-quality reports, measured on a real local corpus. Competitor figures are order-of-magnitude estimates drawn from their public documentation and pricing pages; they are not same-hardware head-to-head results. The chart shows architectural order of magnitude, not a lab comparison.</p>
  </div>
</section>

